{"c":[{"name":"20261022T015815Z-5b6391ace5ed2f9b","text":"pragma_hnsw_index_info count includes deleted rows: the live 39 GiB warehouse reads 280,901 vs 133,793 rows while healthy (1.5.4 and 2.0.0). Count vs count(*) cannot detect a folded index there; an HNSW lookup of a known row by its own vector can. Measured 2026-10-21.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T023054Z-b85bc517446ce9b3","text":"Correction: the live HNSW index's 280,901 entries for 133,793 rows are not proven deleted rows; hnsw_compact_index left them. Unscoped LIMIT 100 returns 40-65 rows. DROP+CREATE+CHECKPOINT (21 s) gives count = rows and 100 of 100. Measured 2026-10-21 on 2.0.0.","type":"note"}]}
